  "identityStatus": "The two named current map outlines place the lighthouse and reconstructed cottage at the crest. The HABS survey sections establish the current proportions, broad east entry and roughly 14 m tower to its crest. The NPS register documents the earlier construction and the ten-foot tower diameter.",
